{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55698","headline":"句 三 · 赞宁","name":"句 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草浓春径狭，树密晚窗阴。\n（均见《锦绣万花谷後集》卷三《春门》。\n）（按：「草浓」二句，《吟窗杂录》作延寿诗。\n未详孰是，今互收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赞宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}